# SAZ1051 (hi3516cv6xx ultimate) rootfs exclusions.
# Processed by general/scripts/rootfs_script.sh AFTER every package has
# installed, so these deletions deterministically win over what the
# packages shipped (unlike `rm -f` inside a package's per-package staging
# dir, which is a no-op for files owned by other packages).
#
# PTZ web endpoints (2026-09-30, video-only board): shipped by the
# majestic-webui dist tarball (cp -r www), but this board has no
# pan/tilt hardware.

/var/www/cgi-bin/j/ptz.cgi
/var/www/a/preview-ptz.js
